WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:22.389
"I can't wait," said Bird.

2
00:00:22.390 --> 00:00:25.977
"Kip is going to be so surprised."

3
00:00:25.978 --> 00:00:28.919
It was Kip's birthday.

4
00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:31.487
Bird was planning a surprise party.

5
00:00:31.488 --> 00:00:34.040
It was going to be at the pond.

6
00:00:34.041 --> 00:00:48.359
Everyone in the park was invited.

7
00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:59.386
Bird flew to her nest for party hats.

8
00:00:59.387 --> 00:01:02.254
Kip poked his head out of his hole.

9
00:01:02.255 --> 00:01:06.293
"Today is my birthday," said Kip.

10
00:01:06.294 --> 00:01:12.162
"I know," said Bird. "Happy Birthday."

11
00:01:12.163 --> 00:01:16.123
"I'll see you at my party," said Kip.

12
00:01:16.124 --> 00:01:18.048
Bird gulped.

13
00:01:18.049 --> 00:01:21.540
"Umm, what party?" she asked.

14
00:01:21.541 --> 00:01:33.637
"I'm planning a party for myself," said Kip.

15
00:01:33.638 --> 00:01:37.504
"It's going to be at the giant rock.

16
00:01:37.505 --> 00:01:40.238
Everyone in the park is invited."

17
00:01:40.239 --> 00:01:43.080
"Oh no!" thought Bird.

18
00:01:43.081 --> 00:01:46.771
Kip was planning his own party!

19
00:01:46.772 --> 00:01:49.951
And Bird was planning a party too.

20
00:01:49.952 --> 00:01:53.118
But Bird couldn't tell Kip.

21
00:01:53.119 --> 00:01:57.763
Her party was a surprise.

22
00:01:57.764 --> 00:02:02.173
"What am I going to do?" wondered Bird.
